            "Leaks: the early lip press, spine straightening before correction, brightening eyes, lifted voice pitch.",
            "Suppression races the expression program and loses the first few hundred milliseconds.",
            "Faked pride overshoots: held smile, puffed chest, display-first timing without the warmth.",
            "Real pride reads as ease; hidden pride leaks; faked pride performs.",
